[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5943.51, "timestamp": "01:39:03", "text": "不知為何，我突然想到，等等，我每天早上 7 點都要到電腦前開始工作、做事情、準備和練習。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5950.709, "timestamp": "01:39:10", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.95, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "我當時就想，我要在我的電腦的 B 碟裡設定一個自動喚醒功能。所以我照做了，結果隔天醒來發現它還沒醒"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5990.367, "timestamp": "01:39:50", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@Reaper lesgoo"}]